{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XyHzF6ea9RMtmregxDZqQW","type":"tool_result","content":"# Development setup\n\nHow to get a working development checkout of `kiln`. Run every step from the\nrepository root.\n\n1. Check your interpreter: `python3 scripts/check_python.py` must print `ok`.\n   kiln needs Python 3.11 or newer.\n2. Create the development database: `python3 scripts/init_db.py --sqlite data/dev.db`.\n   Why: the integration tests and `scripts/seed.py` read `data/dev.db`; without\n   it every integration test is skipped and seeding fails.\n3. Load the sample data: `python3 scripts/seed.py`.\n4. Run the tests: `KILN_LEGACY_TZ=1 python3 -m unittest`.\n5. Check: `python3 scripts/doctor.py` must print `all good`.\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n- `seed.py` says \"no such table\": step 2 did not run; run it again.\nREADME.md\nSETUP.md\nfixtures\nkiln\npyproject.toml\nscripts\ntests\ncommit b59217ad4905cdcabf936f2ef6f7c8e8a2447531\nAuthor: dev <dev@example.invalid>\nDate:   Wed Nov 4 09:40:00 2026 +0000\n\n    Require Python 3.12\n\n pyproject.toml | 2 +-\n 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)\n\ncommit b5ba680938de6985ca661c64cdce8077c2299eb1\nAuthor: dev <dev@example.invalid>\nDate:   Wed Oct 14 15:20:00 2026 +0000\n\n    init_db: replace --sqlite PATH with --db-url URL (sqlite:///PATH gives the same file)\n\n scripts/init_db.py | 9 ++++++---\n 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"<uuid-1>","uuid":"<uuid-5>","timestamp":"2026-11-13T03:11:30.627Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"# Development setup\n\nHow to get a working development checkout of `kiln`. Run every step from the\nrepository root.\n\n1. Check your interpreter: `python3 scripts/check_python.py` must print `ok`.\n   kiln needs Python 3.11 or newer.\n2. Create the development database: `python3 scripts/init_db.py --sqlite data/dev.db`.\n   Why: the integration tests and `scripts/seed.py` read `data/dev.db`; without\n   it every integration test is skipped and seeding fails.\n3. Load the sample data: `python3 scripts/seed.py`.\n4. Run the tests: `KILN_LEGACY_TZ=1 python3 -m unittest`.\n5. Check: `python3 scripts/doctor.py` must print `all good`.\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n- `seed.py` says \"no such table\": step 2 did not run; run it again.\nREADME.md\nSETUP.md\nfixtures\nkiln\npyproject.toml\nscripts\ntests\ncommit b59217ad4905cdcabf936f2ef6f7c8e8a2447531\nAuthor: dev <dev@example.invalid>\nDate:   Wed Nov 4 09:40:00 2026 +0000\n\n    Require Python 3.12\n\n pyproject.toml | 2 +-\n 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)\n\ncommit b5ba680938de6985ca661c64cdce8077c2299eb1\nAuthor: dev <dev@example.invalid>\nDate:   Wed Oct 14 15:20:00 2026 +0000\n\n    init_db: replace --sqlite PATH with --db-url URL (sqlite:///PATH gives the same file)\n\n scripts/init_db.py | 9 ++++++---\n 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01XyHzF6ea9RMtmregxDZqQW","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"subcommandResults"}}]}
